## Main
Let mutable sum be 0.
Let mutable i be 1.
While i is at most 1000:
    Set sum to sum + i.
    Set i to i + 1.
Show sum.
Show 100000 + sum.
Let mutable count be 0.
Let mutable n be 2.
While n is at most 50:
    Let mutable d be 2.
    Let mutable prime be 1.
    While d is less than n:
        If n % d is equal to 0:
            Set prime to 0.
        Set d to d + 1.
    Set count to count + prime.
    Set n to n + 1.
Show count.
